The natural continuation connects this geometry to [entropy rate](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Entropy_rate), [Hausdorff dimension](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hausdorff_dimension), and explicit models of [tree traversal](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tree_traversal). Periodic profiles are exact calibration cases for stochastic estimators and policy-sensitive cost laws.

